The official currency of the Falkland Islands is the Falkland Pound (FKP), the value of which is set as equal to one British pound (GBP).
It is possible to exchange money in the only bank on the islands, located in Stanley, opposite the FIC West store.
In general, British pounds are accepted everywhere in the Isles, and credit cards and U.S. dollars are often accepted at Stanley.
Credit cards are unlikely to be accepted in Peripheral islands, even though British and United States currencies may be accepted; consult the owners beforehand to determine the appropriate payment method.
It is almost impossible to exchange Falkland's currency outside the islands, so exchange money before leaving the islands.
